  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets (including the stalk!). Cut carrot into half-moons. Place on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc542746dd895cd0b3e06/step-50659700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, boil the kettle. Peel potato and cut into large chunks. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook potato in boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 mins.\n• Drain and return to saucepan. Add the milk, butter and a generous pinch of salt and mash until smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc542746dd895cd0b3e06/step-f61be710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop brown onion (see ingredients). Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Stir in lentils, Mumbai spice blend, mild North Indian spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Add the water and roasted veggies and cook until thickened, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc542746dd895cd0b3e06/step-63f38a20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high. Transfer lentil mixture to a baking dish and top with mash. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill until lightly golden, 5-7 mins.\n• Divide lentil and cauliflower pie between plates to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc542746dd895cd0b3e06/step-35c08530.jpg"
    }
  ]
